  "description": "A travel planner that asks other publishers' agents for help: WebAir Flights for the flights and Staymere for the hotels, each a signed package pinned by digest, and its own calendar check. The model chooses whom to consult, within a declared envelope. All data is fictional; nothing is booked.",
